{"seq":1,"slug":"debug-adapter-protocol","title":"Debug Adapter Protocol 详解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/debugger-extension/debug-adapter-protocol","wordCount":702,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"debug-adapter-protocol-详解\">Debug Adapter Protocol 详解</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Debug Adapter Protocol（DAP）是微软提出的调试器标准化协议，设计理念与 LSP 如出一辙——通过在编辑器（前端）和调试器实现（后端）之间引入一层标准化协议，实现<strong>调试器的跨编辑器复用</strong>。一个实现了 DAP 的调试适配器可以同时被 VS Code、Neovim、Eclipse 等支持 DAP 的编辑器使用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[VS Code UI] --&gt; B[DAP 客户端]&#10;    C[Neovim UI] --&gt; D[DAP 客户端]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Debug Adapter&lt;br/&gt;Node.js]&#10;    B --&gt; F[Debug Adapter&lt;br/&gt;Python]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; G[Node.js 运行时]&#10;    F --&gt; H[Python 运行时]\">flowchart TD\n    A[VS Code UI] --&gt; B[DAP 客户端]\n    C[Neovim UI] --&gt; D[DAP 客户端]\n    B --&gt; E[Debug Adapter&lt;br/&gt;Node.js]\n    B --&gt; F[Debug Adapter&lt;br/&gt;Python]\n    D --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; G[Node.js 运行时]\n    F --&gt; H[Python 运行时]</pre><p>DAP 与 LSP 的设计对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>LSP</th>\n<th>DAP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解决问题</td>\n<td>语言智能特性的编辑器复用</td>\n<td>调试器的编辑器复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通信协议</td>\n<td>JSON-RPC 2.0</td>\n<td>自定义 JSON 协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输方式</td>\n<td>stdio / socket / pipe</td>\n<td>stdio / socket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期</td>\n<td>长连接（编辑器运行期间）</td>\n<td>会话级（调试期间）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态模型</td>\n<td>无状态（文档为单位）</td>\n<td>有状态（调试会话）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型实现</td>\n<td>Language Server</td>\n<td>Debug Adapter</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"协议消息模型\">协议消息模型</h2><p>DAP 使用与 LSP 类似但不完全相同的 JSON 消息格式。每条消息由 HTTP 风格的头部和 JSON 体组成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ProtocolMessage {&#10;  seq: number;&#10;  type: &#39;request&#39; | &#39;response&#39; | &#39;event&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Request extends ProtocolMessage {&#10;  type: &#39;request&#39;;&#10;  command: string;&#10;  arguments?: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Response extends ProtocolMessage {&#10;  type: &#39;response&#39;;&#10;  request_seq: number;&#10;  success: boolean;&#10;  command: string;&#10;  message?: string;&#10;  body?: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Event extends ProtocolMessage {&#10;  type: &#39;event&#39;;&#10;  event: string;&#10;  body?: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProtocolMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  seq</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'request'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'response'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'event'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProtocolMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'request'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  command</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  arguments</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProtocolMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'response'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  request_seq</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  success</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  command</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProtocolMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'event'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 编辑器 (Client)&#10;    participant A as Debug Adapter&#10;    participant R as 运行时 (Debuggee)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;A: initialize Request&#10;    A--&gt;&gt;C: initialize Response (capabilities)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;A: launch/attach Request&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;R: 启动/连接目标程序&#10;    A--&gt;&gt;C: launch/attach Response&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;C: initialized Event&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;A: setBreakpoints Request&#10;    A--&gt;&gt;C: setBreakpoints Response&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;A: configurationDone Request&#10;    A--&gt;&gt;C: configurationDone Response&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;A: 命中断点&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;C: stopped Event&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;A: threads Request&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;A: stackTrace Request&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;A: scopes/variables Request&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;A: continue Request&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;R: 继续执行\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 编辑器 (Client)\n    participant A as Debug Adapter\n    participant R as 运行时 (Debuggee)\n    C-&gt;&gt;A: initialize Request\n    A--&gt;&gt;C: initialize Response (capabilities)\n    C-&gt;&gt;A: launch/attach Request\n    A-&gt;&gt;R: 启动/连接目标程序\n    A--&gt;&gt;C: launch/attach Response\n    A-&gt;&gt;C: initialized Event\n    C-&gt;&gt;A: setBreakpoints Request\n    A--&gt;&gt;C: setBreakpoints Response\n    C-&gt;&gt;A: configurationDone Request\n    A--&gt;&gt;C: configurationDone Response\n    R-&gt;&gt;A: 命中断点\n    A-&gt;&gt;C: stopped Event\n    C-&gt;&gt;A: threads Request\n    C-&gt;&gt;A: stackTrace Request\n    C-&gt;&gt;A: scopes/variables Request\n    C-&gt;&gt;A: continue Request\n    A-&gt;&gt;R: 继续执行</pre><p>DAP 定义了三种消息类型，与 LSP 的 Request/Response/Notification 类似：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Request</td>\n<td>Client → Adapter</td>\n<td>客户端发起请求</td>\n<td>launch, setBreakpoints, continue</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Response</td>\n<td>Adapter → Client</td>\n<td>适配器响应请求</td>\n<td>每个 Request 对应一个 Response</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Event</td>\n<td>Adapter → Client</td>\n<td>适配器主动通知</td>\n<td>stopped, output, terminated</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"调试会话生命周期\">调试会话生命周期</h2><p>DAP 调试会话遵循严格的状态流转：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Uninitialized&#10;    Uninitialized --&gt; Initialized: initialize&#10;    Initialized --&gt; Configuring: launch/attach&#10;    Configuring --&gt; Running: configurationDone&#10;    Running --&gt; Stopped: stopped event&#10;    Stopped --&gt; Running: continue/step&#10;    Running --&gt; Terminated: terminated event&#10;    Stopped --&gt; Terminated: disconnect&#10;    Terminated --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Uninitialized\n    Uninitialized --&gt; Initialized: initialize\n    Initialized --&gt; Configuring: launch/attach\n    Configuring --&gt; Running: configurationDone\n    Running --&gt; Stopped: stopped event\n    Stopped --&gt; Running: continue/step\n    Running --&gt; Terminated: terminated event\n    Stopped --&gt; Terminated: disconnect\n    Terminated --&gt; [*]</pre><p><strong>Initialize 阶段</strong>：客户端和适配器交换能力，类似 LSP 的初始化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface InitializeRequestArguments {&#10;  clientID?: string;&#10;  clientName?: string;&#10;  adapterID: string;&#10;  pathFormat?: &#39;path&#39; | &#39;uri&#39;;&#10;  linesStartAt1?: boolean;&#10;  columnsStartAt1?: boolean;&#10;  supportsVariableType?: boolean;&#10;  supportsVariablePaging?: boolean;&#10;  supportsRunInTerminalRequest?: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Capabilities {&#10;  supportsConfigurationDoneRequest?: boolean;&#10;  supportsConditionalBreakpoints?: boolean;&#10;  supportsHitConditionalBreakpoints?: boolean;&#10;  supportsEvaluateForHovers?: boolean;&#10;  supportsStepBack?: boolean;&#10;  supportsSetVariable?: boolean;&#10;  supportsRestartRequest?: boolean;&#10;  supportsExceptionInfoRequest?: boolean;&#10;  supportsDataBreakpoints?: boolean;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InitializeRequestArguments</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"