</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  variablesReference</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  namedVariables</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  indexedVariables</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当程序在断点处停止时，客户端通过一系列请求获取程序状态：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[stopped Event] --&gt; B[&quot;threads Request&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;stackTrace Request&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;scopes Request&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;variables Request&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[展示调试面板]&#10;    F --&gt; G{用户操作}&#10;    G --&gt; H[continue / step]&#10;    G --&gt; I[evaluate 表达式]&#10;    G --&gt; J[setVariable 修改变量]\">flowchart TD\n    A[stopped Event] --&gt; B[\"threads Request\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"stackTrace Request\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"scopes Request\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"variables Request\"]\n    E --&gt; F[展示调试面板]\n    F --&gt; G{用户操作}\n    G --&gt; H[continue / step]\n    G --&gt; I[evaluate 表达式]\n    G --&gt; J[setVariable 修改变量]</pre><h2 id=\"事件机制\">事件机制</h2><p>事件是适配器主动向客户端推送状态变化的机制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const dapEvents = {&#10;  initialized: &#39;适配器初始化完成，可以设置断点&#39;,&#10;  stopped: &#39;程序停止（断点、异常、暂停等）&#39;,&#10;  continued: &#39;程序继续执行&#39;,&#10;  exited: &#39;目标程序退出（exitCode）&#39;,&#10;  terminated: &#39;调试会话结束&#39;,&#10;  thread: &#39;线程创建或销毁&#39;,&#10;  output: &#39;程序输出（stdout/stderr/console）&#39;,&#10;  breakpoint: &#39;断点状态变化（验证结果）&#39;,&#10;  module: &#39;模块加载/卸载&#39;,&#10;  loadedSource: &#39;源码加载&#39;,&#10;  process: &#39;进程信息&#39;,&#10;  progressStart: &#39;长任务开始&#39;,&#10;  progressUpdate: &#39;长任务进度更新&#39;,&#10;  progressEnd: &#39;长任务结束&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dapEvents</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  initialized: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'适配器初始化完成，可以设置断点'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stopped: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'程序停止（断点、异常、暂停等）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  continued: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'程序继续执行'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  exited: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'目标程序退出（exitCode）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  terminated: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'调试会话结束'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  thread: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'线程创建或销毁'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  output: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'程序输出（stdout/stderr/console）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  breakpoint: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'断点状态变化（验证结果）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  module: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'模块加载/卸载'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  loadedSource: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'源码加载'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  process: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'进程信息'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  progressStart: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'长任务开始'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  progressUpdate: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'长任务进度更新'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  progressEnd: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'长任务结束'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>stopped</code> 事件是最关键的事件，它携带了停止原因：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>停止原因</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>breakpoint</td>\n<td>命中断点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>step</td>\n<td>单步执行完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>exception</td>\n<td>发生异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pause</td>\n<td>用户暂停</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>entry</td>\n<td>程序入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>goto</td>\n<td>跳转到指定位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>data breakpoint</td>\n<td>数据断点触发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((DAP 协议))&#10;    设计理念&#10;      调试器与编辑器解耦&#10;      标准化协议&#10;      跨编辑器复用&#10;    消息模型&#10;      Request/Response&#10;      Event 异步通知&#10;      seq 序列号&#10;    生命周期&#10;      initialize 能力协商&#10;      launch/attach 启动&#10;      configurationDone 就绪&#10;      terminate 结束&#10;    核心功能&#10;      断点管理&#10;      执行控制&#10;      状态查询&#10;      表达式求值&#10;    事件机制&#10;      stopped 停止通知&#10;      output 输出转发&#10;      thread 线程管理\">mindmap\n  root((DAP 协议))\n    设计理念\n      调试器与编辑器解耦\n      标准化协议\n      跨编辑器复用\n    消息模型\n      Request/Response\n      Event 异步通知\n      seq 序列号\n    生命周期\n      initialize 能力协商\n      launch/attach 启动\n      configurationDone 就绪\n      terminate 结束\n    核心功能\n      断点管理\n      执行控制\n      状态查询\n      表达式求值\n    事件机制\n      stopped 停止通知\n      output 输出转发\n      thread 线程管理</pre><ul>\n<li>DAP 通过标准化协议实现调试器的跨编辑器复用，设计理念与 LSP 一脉相承</li>\n<li>调试会话遵循 initialize → launch/attach → configurationDone → running → stopped → terminated 的状态流转</li>\n<li>客户端通过 threads → stackTrace → scopes → variables 的请求链获取程序停止时的完整状态</li>\n<li>Event 机制使适配器能够主动推送程序状态变化，如断点命中、程序输出等</li>\n<li>Launch 和 Attach 两种模式覆盖了本地调试和远程调试的需求</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Debug Adapter Protocol 详解","id":"debug-adapter-protocol-详解"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"协议消息模型","id":"协议消息模型"},{"level":2,"text":"调试会话生命周期","id":"调试会话生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"核心请求类型","id":"核心请求类型"},{"level":2,"text":"事件机制","id":"事件机制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"增量解析与性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/language-server/incremental-parsing"},"next":{"title":"自定义调试器开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/debugger-extension/custom-debugger"}}